     1,
     "<div>Please refer to <a href=\"https://stat.ethz.ch/pipermail/r-help/2005-February/066041.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stat.ethz.ch/pipermail/r-help/2005-February/066041.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238854424000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tBu5Z_6efAIw9_4nAycNg\">https://stat.ethz.ch/pipermail/r-help/2005-February/066041.html</a></div><div><span style=\"font-size:13px\">主要的原因, 從 help file (看help file 指令: </span><span style=\"font-size:13px\">? fisher.test) </span><span style=\"font-size:13px\">來看:  </span><br></div><div><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:inherit;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit\">\r\n\r\n      Note this fails (with an error message) when the entries of the table\r\n      are too large.</span>\r\n\r\nNote, the _entries_, not the dimensions.  The issue is how many tables\r\nneed to be enumerated.</pre></div><br><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Brian D. Ripley 的建議是你應該用 log-linear model 來了解資料間的dependence, 然後可以藉此更了解你的data.</pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">For anyone wants to reproduce the result:</pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">table &lt;- matrix(c(32, 153, 167, 86, 3, 5234, 13017, 4088, 883, 225, 3, 8, 1, 2, 1), 3, 5, dimnames= list(B13 = c(1:3), B14 = c(1:5)))</pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">fisher.test(table)</pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">如果只是想讓他動:</pre><pre><font color=\"#000000\">fisher.test(a, simulate.p.value = TRUE, B = 20000)<br></font></pre>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<pre><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></pre><pre><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></pre><br>On Thursday, April 25, 2013 4:18:26 AM UTC-7, 馬來糕 wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">請教一下！ </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">先提一下..... </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">我有一份2萬多筆的回卷資料， </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">以spss跑卡方獨立性檢定時， </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">發現每個cell的期望值小於5的格子數約佔33.3%， </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">所以我改用Fisher&#39;s exact test跑資料， </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">可是spss的報表說記憶體不足， </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">跑不出來， </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">用sas跑也出現同樣的問題。 </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">所以我去國家高速網路與計算中心， </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">申請了一個帳號， </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">準備用R跑看看， </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">我就參考TKU NET.Stat的語法去跑， </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font color=\"#009900\">&gt;if(!exists(&quot;chisq.test&quot;, mode=&quot;function&quot;)) <br></font><span style=\"color:rgb(0